/*
 * tag/03-memfault - custom Memfault metrics
 *
 * Shows up in the nRFCloud dashboard alongside the automatic BLE metrics
 * (ncs_bt_connection_count, ncs_bt_connection_time_ms).
 * Docs: https://docs.memfault.com/docs/embedded/metrics-api
